<view class="page-shell"><view class="hero-card"><view class="eyebrow">移动运营</view><view class="hero-title">学习会记录</view><view class="hero-copy">仅显示当前组织授权范围内的正式学习会事实记录。</view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state-card">正在加载…</view><view wx:if="{{!loading && errorMessage}}" class="state-card error">{{errorMessage}}</view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !errorMessage && !records.length}}" class="section-card">暂无可查看的学习会记录。</view><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="section-card"><view class="section-title">{{item.class_name}} · {{item.group_name}}</view><view>{{item.meeting_date}} · {{item.status}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.course_name_snapshot || '未记录课程'}} · {{item.total_count || 0}} 人</view></view></view>
